## Objective

Sprint 31 introduced a formal vulnerability management and remediation workflow into the SOC lab.

The objectives were to:

- Inventory a Windows asset
- Review basic security configuration
- Identify a controlled vulnerability
- Validate the vulnerability from a second endpoint
- Assess likelihood and impact
- Assign severity
- Create a remediation plan
- Implement remediation
- Verify remediation
- Close the vulnerability
- Document remediation metrics and SLA performance

The primary vulnerability-management artifact created was:

```text
VM-001 — Windows Configuration Vulnerability Assessment
```

The controlled finding was:

```text
VULN-001 — Overly Permissive SMB Share
```

